{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a Shopify Online Store 2.0 "Find Plant Category" section for a premium plant nursery.
    
    DESIGN:
    - Light cream/off-white background (#f9f6f1 or similar)
    - Section heading: "Find Plant Category" where "Category" is in elegant italic style
    - Plant categories displayed in a responsive grid
    - Each category has a large circular/oval image with white border and subtle drop shadow
    - Category name centered below each image
    - Final "Buy Now!" CTA card at the end of the grid, fully editable
    
    CATEGORY CARDS (each is an editable block):
    - Category name (text)
    - Main/default image (Shopify image picker)
    - Separate hover image (Shopify image picker)
    - Shopify link picker (per card, independent URL)
    - Enable/disable toggle
    - Image size control
    - Border width, color, radius
    - Shadow toggle
    - Text size, text color
    
    HOVER EFFECT:
    - Show main image normally; on hover, smoothly fade to the hover image
    - CSS opacity transition only (no zoom/crop/distort/stretch)
    - Keep images perfectly aligned and same size during hover
    - On mobile/touch: show normal image, entire card is clickable
    
    LINK BEHAVIOR:
    - Entire image + category name is clickable
    - Each block has its own independent Shopify URL (url type)
    
    LAYOUT:
    - Desktop: configurable columns (default 5), responsive grid
    - Tablet: auto-reduced columns
    - Mobile: 2-column layout
    - No horizontal scroll, long names wrap naturally
    
    THEME EDITOR SETTINGS (section level):
    - Heading text, font size, weight, color
    - Italic toggle for "Category" word
    - Background color
    - Columns: desktop, tablet, mobile
    - Grid gap, image size, border width/color/radius
    - Shadow on/off, category font size/weight/color
    - Hover transition speed
    - Section padding top/bottom
    
    CTA BLOCK (separate block type):
    - CTA heading, subtext, button label, button link
    - CTA background color, text color, button color, button text color, border radius
    
    TECHNICAL:
    - Shopify OS 2.0 section with blocks
    - Pure Liquid, scoped CSS, minimal vanilla JS only if needed
    - image_picker and url type for each block
    - Complete schema with presets
    - No hardcoded names, images, or URLs
    - Fully responsive, lightweight
    Create a Shopify Online Store 2.0 "Find Plant Category" section matching the uploaded reference images.
    
