    - When the user hovers over the image/card, smoothly replace the main image with the separate hover image from the Theme Editor.
    - Use a smooth fade/opacity transition.
    - Keep the image perfectly aligned and the same size during hover.
    - Add a subtle premium hover effect without excessive animation.
