    - CTA border radius
    
    IMPORTANT:
    - Do not hard-code category names, images or URLs.
    - Every category must be editable from the Shopify Theme Editor.
    - Each category must support TWO images: normal image + hover image.
    - Each category must have its OWN link.
    - Use Shopify image picker and Shopify link picker.
    - Make the complete section responsive, lightweight and compatible with Shopify Online Store 2.0.
